 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-10T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2488) 'The cage-wrapped net segments the body and garment into per-vertex part and panel labels.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-10T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2488) 'Every part that is not the body base becomes a VRM spring-bone chain.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-10T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2488) 'SkinTokens gives the body base skeleton and weights; the chains swing on their own.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-10T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2488) 'Rest lengths come from the mesh; spring stiffness and damping are tuned.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

