 Text:Written

2026-11-10T00:00:23Z (RFD66606-2488) 'The two layers
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-10T00:00:24Z (RFD66606-2488) '- The segmentation net: CageNet builds a manifold cage; DiffusionNet runs on the cage; the mapping operator P projects per-vertex part and panel labels back to the messy mesh.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-10T00:00:25Z (RFD66606-2488) '- The independent bodies: VRM spring-bone chains for every part that is not the body base.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-10T00:00:26Z (RFD66606-2488) '- Stiff parts (belt, collar, hat) use short chains or a rigid pivot at the attachment bone.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-10T00:00:27Z (RFD66606-2488) '- Soft fabric (skirt, dress, sleeves) is a cloth approximated by spring-bone chains that Cassie VBD drives.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-10T00:00:28Z (RFD66606-2488) 'Why the cage
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-10T00:00:29Z (RFD66606-2488) 'DiffusionNet alone does not communicate between distinct components.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-10T00:00:30Z (RFD66606-2488) 'The single manifold cage lets one net see across hair, clothes and eyes.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-10T00:00:31Z (RFD66606-2488) 'So it is the part-label engine for the garment and the body.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

