 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-10T00:00:34Z (RFD66606-2488) '- Everything else: a VRM spring-bone chain.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-10T00:00:35Z (RFD66606-2488) '- Belt, collar, skirt, dress, sleeves, shawl, hair, tail, scarf.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-10T00:00:36Z (RFD66606-2488) '- Each chain carries bones with rest lengths from the mesh, tuned stiffness, damping and collision shapes.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

