 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-10T00:00:38Z (RFD66606-2488) '- GarmentCodeData v2 (CC BY 4.0): the garment mesh, per-vertex panel segmentation, waist and collar vertex labels, the sewing specification, and body measurements. The segmentation is the carving; the scrappy path uses it directly without the net.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-10T00:00:39Z (RFD66606-2488) '- Articulation-XL 2.0 (CC BY 4.0): models, skeletons, meshes, skins and point clouds. Feeds SkinTokens evaluation, which was trained on it.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2488  1 LINE
 Text:Written

